A.text:
Use `DATATABLE` — it lets you define column names and explicit data types.

```dax
EVALUATE
DATATABLE (
    "Customer", STRING,
    "Quantity", INTEGER,
    "Revenue", CURRENCY,
    {
        { "A", 1, 10.5 },
        { "B", 2, 20.0 }
    }
)
```

