Use `DATATABLE`.

```dax
EVALUATE
DATATABLE (
    "Name", STRING,
    "Qty", INTEGER,
    "Price", CURRENCY,
    {
        { "Apple", 2, 1.5 },
        { "Banana", 5, 0.9 }
    }
)
```
